            <div xml:id="d495">

                <pb facs="0691" n="567" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg567"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.34/64: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-12-15T18:00:00-07:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 15,
                                1923—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 16—1:07
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>135. Executive requests through Foreign Office that the Embassy inquire whether
                    the United States will consider immediate sale to the Mexican Government of two
                    discarded naval cruisers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
